    Tolerate non-case JSON in the institutional case store
    
    The live store contains an evidence-only JSON list and an empty placeholder
    file alongside case objects. Reconciliation aborted with an AttributeError on
    the list, so the whole pass - including index regeneration - would fail in
    production. Restore the deployed guard that normalises a valid non-dict
    document to an empty case, and exclude non-case documents from the index and
    report paths. Regression seeds both live-observed shapes.

diff --git a/government/institutional-cases.py b/government/institutional-cases.py
